[size=4][b]Latest version: 0.2.0[/b][/size]
Added: on/off wear hints. Each wear tier change shows a short notice (e.g. "Your blade is dulling (Dulled)"), and you can toggle them from the Inspect Gear power or with [font=Courier New]set SCS_WearHints to 0[/font]. Changed: reworded the tier messages. With hints off, a repair still says "Repaired.". No SKSE, no update loops, no vanilla records edited. ESL-flagged, Skyrim.esm only. Early beta; automated checks pass, not playtested in game yet.

Full release notes and source: [url=https://github.com/Blackshield-Company/scarred-steel/releases/tag/v0.2.0]GitHub[/url]
